Description: GoSpot digital voice dashboard (Pi-Star compatible)
 Includes the operator UI, HTTPS management UI, Go service and restricted
 configuration helpers for the radio configuration files. Replaces the
 pistar-dashboard package and migrates its settings, credentials and state.
